{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for integrative, personalized session planning and VIP Day offers.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#fbfbfb;
      --card:#ffffff;
      --muted:#6b6b6b;
      --accent:#2b7a6f;
      --accent-2:#1f5a4f;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --radius:12px;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#111}
    body{
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      background-attachment: fixed;
      background-position: right top;
      background-size: 28%;
    }
    header{padding:22px 28px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    nav a.primary{background:var(--accent);color:white}
    main{max-width:1100px;margin:18px auto;padding:22px}
    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:26px}
    .card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:var(--radius);box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(18,24,27,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted)}
    .contact-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .contact-item{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .meta{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
    .muted-small{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    /* Session Planner styles */
    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#222}
    input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e6e6e6;font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:92px;resize:vertical}
    button{background:var(--accent);border:none;color:white;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer}
    .secondary{background:transparent;border:1px solid #ddd;color:#333}
    .small{padding:8px 10px;font-size:13px}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:#f7f7f8;padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px dashed #e3e3e3}

    footer{margin:26px auto 60px;max-width:1100px;padding:12px 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* reveal animation */
    .reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px);transition:opacity .6s ease,transform .6s ease}
    .reveal.visible{opacity:1;transform:none}

    @media (max-width:900px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      body{background-size:46%}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">HM</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:700">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="index.html">Welcome</a>
      <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Support</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Method</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Investments</a>
      <a href="about.html">Our Team</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      <a href="contact.html" aria-current="page">Connect</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="card reveal" id="contact-top">
      <h1>Connect with our integrative practice</h1>
      <p class="lead">If you're exploring a tailored approach to better energy, clearer sleep, or steadier moods, start here. Use the planner to sketch a first session plan, then reach out to set a consult.</p>

      <div class="grid">
        <div>
          <div class="card" style="margin-bottom:16px">
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">How to reach us</h2>
            <div class="contact-list">
              <div class="contact-item"><strong>Phone</strong><div class="meta" style="margin-left:auto">{{PHONE}}</div></div>
              <div class="contact-item"><strong>Email</strong><div class="meta" style="margin-left:auto">{{EMAIL}}</div></div>
              <div class="contact-item"><strong>Location</strong><div class="meta" style="margin-left:auto">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div></div>
            </div>
            <p class="muted-small" style="margin-top:12px">If you prefer, schedule a dedicated VIP Day to explore an in-depth plan and hands-on coaching. Ask about availability and next steps when you contact us.</p>
            <p style="margin-top:12px"><a class="small" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}"><button class="small">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button></a></p>
          </div>

          <div class="card reveal" id="contact-form">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Message us</h3>
            <form id="messageForm">
              <div class="row"><input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required></div>
              <div class="row"><input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required></div>
              <div class="row"><input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" placeholder="Short subject (e.g., sleep, energy)"></div>
              <div class="row"><textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us briefly what you hope to address"></textarea></div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
                <button type="submit">Send message</button>
                <button type="button" class="secondary small" id="clearForm">Clear</button>
              </div>
            </form>
            <p class="muted-small">We respond within 2 business days. Messages are for appointment requests and questions—this is not emergency care. For urgent concerns, call local emergency services.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside>
          <div class="card reveal" id="planner">
            <h3 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h3>
            <p class="muted-small">A short interactive tool to help you and your clinician translate goals into a single-session outline and a suggested 4-week starter sequence. Build, copy, or download your plan to share before booking.</p>

            <form id="plannerForm">
              <label for="goal">Primary goal</label>
              <input id="goal" name="goal" placeholder="E.g., Improve sleep quality, reduce daily anxiety" required>

              <label for="availability">Weekly time you can devote</label>
              <select id="availability" name="availability">
                <option value="30">~30 minutes/week</option>
                <option value="60">~1 hour/week</option>
                <option value="120">~2 hours/week</option>
                <option value="240">~4+ hours/week</option>
              </select>

              <label>Focus areas (choose up to 3)</label>
              <div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:10px">
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="mindfulness"> Mindfulness</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="movement"> Movement</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="nutrition"> Nutrition</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="sleep"> Sleep</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="stress"> Stress resilience</label>
                <label><input type="checkbox" name="focus" value="bloodwork"> Labs/snaps</label>
              </div>

              <label for="constraints">Practical constraints</label>
              <input id="constraints" name="constraints" placeholder="e.g., travel, caregiving, limited mobility">

              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;margin-top:12px">
                <button type="button" id="buildPlan">Build plan</button>
                <button type="button" id="copyPlan" class="secondary">Copy text</button>
                <button type="button" id="downloadPlan" class="secondary">Download .txt</button>
              </div>
            </form>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <div class="muted-small">Plan preview</div>
              <div id="planOutput" class="output" aria-live="polite">No plan yet. Use the builder to create a short, practical plan.</div>
            </div>

          </div>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div>© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — thoughtful, evidence-informed integrative care. Contact: {{EMAIL}} • {{PHONE}}</div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    /* Scroll-triggered reveals with reduced-motion respect */
    (function(){
      const prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
      const reveals = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal');
      if(prefersReduced){
        reveals.forEach(el=>el.classList.add('visible'));
        return;
      }
      const obs = new IntersectionObserver((entries, observer)=>{
        entries.forEach(entry=>{
          if(entry.isIntersecting){
            entry.target.classList.add('visible');
            observer.unobserve(entry.target);
          }
        });
      },{threshold:0.12});
      reveals.forEach(el=>obs.observe(el));
    })();

    /* Simple contact form behavior (no server) */
    document.getElementById('messageForm').addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const name = document.getElementById('name').value.trim();
      const email = document.getElementById('email').value.trim();
      const subj = document.getElementById('subject').value.trim();
      const msg = document.getElementById('message').value.trim();
      // Simulated submit
      alert('Thanks, ' + (name||'there') + '. Your message has been queued. We will reply to ' + (email||'your email') + '.');
      this.reset();
    });
    document.getElementById('clearForm').addEventListener('click', function(){
      document.getElementById('messageForm').reset();
    });

    /* Session Planner: builds plaintext summary, copy, download */
    function gatherPlanner(){
      const goal = document.getElementById('goal').value.trim();
      const availability = parseInt(document.getElementById('availability').value,10);
      const constraints = document.getElementById('constraints').value.trim();
      const focusEls = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('input[name="focus"]:checked')).map(n=>n.value);
      return {goal,availability,constraints,focus:focusEls};
    }

    function friendlyTime(mins){
      if(mins<60) return mins + ' min/week';
      return (mins/60) + ' hr/week';
    }

    function recommendSessionCount(availability){
      // rough framing: more time => layered plan
      if(availability<=30) return 1;
      if(availability<=60) return 2;
      if(availability<=120) return 3;
      return 4;
    }

    function buildPlaintextPlan(data){
      const sessCount = recommendSessionCount(data.availability);
      const focusLine = data.focus.length? data.focus.join(', ') : 'General integrative review';
      const lines = [];
      lines.push('{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Session planner');
      lines.push('Primary goal: ' + (data.goal || '—'));
      lines.push('Focus: ' + focusLine);
      lines.push('Weekly time available: ' + friendlyTime(data.availability));
      if(data.constraints) lines.push('Practical constraints: ' + data.constraints);
      lines.push('');
      lines.push('Single-session outline (60 min frame suggested):');
      lines.push('1. Brief history & priority setting (10-12 min)');
      lines.push('2. Focused intake & simple measures (10 min) — sleep, activity, mood screening');
      lines.push('3. Practical strategies & skill introduction (20 min) — chosen based on focus areas');
      lines.push('4. Concrete starter tasks & resources (10 min)');
      lines.push('5. Next steps (5-8 min) — labs, referrals, follow-up cadence');
      lines.push('');
      lines.push('Starter 4-week sequence (proposed):');
      for(let w=1; w<=4; w++){
        lines.push('Week ' + w + ': ' + (w===1 ? 'Foundations — small, high-impact habits' : w===2 ? 'Skill practice & habit building' : w===3 ? 'Adjust & add focused interventions' : 'Consolidate & plan forward'));
      }
      lines.push('');
      lines.push('Recommended touchpoints: ' + sessCount + ' short sessions over 4 weeks (combined 1:1 and brief check-ins), then review.');
      lines.push('');
      lines.push('Notes for clinician / patient:');
      lines.push('- Keep tasks small and specific.');
      lines.push('- Prioritize one measurable behavior in week 1.');
      lines.push('- Add labs or referrals only when they change management.');
      lines.push('');
      lines.push('Prepared: ' + new Date().toLocaleString());
      return lines.join('\n');
    }

    document.getElementById('buildPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const data = gatherPlanner();
      const out = buildPlaintextPlan(data);
      document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent = out;
    });

    document.getElementById('copyPlan').addEventListener('click', async function(){
      const text = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent;
      if(!text) return;
      try{
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
        this.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(()=>this.textContent='Copy text',1200);
      }catch(e){
        alert('Copy failed — select and copy the text manually.');
      }
    });

    document.getElementById('downloadPlan').addEventListener('click', function(){
      const text = document.getElementById('planOutput').textContent;
      if(!text) return;
      const blob = new Blob([text],{type:'text/plain'});
      const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
      const a = document.createElement('a');
      a.href = url;
      const name = (document.getElementById('goal').value||'plan').toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g,'-');
      a.download = (name||'session-plan') + '.txt';
      document.body.appendChild(a);
      a.click();
      a.remove();
      URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
    });

  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"# holistic_medicine-MORE-2026-02-17T21-35-40-592Z-042 — Chunk 4

This bundle includes the contact page and a short README for the holistic / integrative medicine template.

Files:
- contact.html — Contact page with navigation, messaging form (client-side simulated), and an on-page "Session Planner" interactive widget. The planner builds a plaintext session plan, supports copying to clipboard and downloading as a .txt file. It also implements scroll-triggered section reveals with respect for prefers-reduced-motion.

Placeholders used in templates (do not replace in source until runtime):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Notes on behavior and developer guidance:
- The contact form is simulated (no backend) and will alert the user on submit. Adapt to your server endpoint by changing the form submit handler in contact.html.
- The Session Planner builds a concise plan with a 1-session outline and a 4-week starter sequence. It is intentionally educational and does not make medical claims.
- Scroll-triggered reveals use IntersectionObserver unless the user prefers reduced motion, in which case sections are revealed instantly.
- The page references a local SVG at assets/img/pattern.svg for decorative background. Provide a unique pattern SVG at that path for final builds.

Accessibility:
- Reduced-motion preference is respected.
- The plan output uses aria-live="polite" so screen readers will announce updates.

Local testing:
1. Place this file alongside the rest of the site HTML files (index.html, services.html, etc.) and ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists.
2. Open contact.html in a browser. For full JS features, serve the page over a local static server (e.g., `python -m http.server` or similar) to avoid any clipboard/download quirks.

License: Provided as-is for use with the holistic_medicine layout family. No external assets or CDNs are included."}
